RoysTrialTalk:
Text(PostGame_RoysTrialDesc)
TextWindow(PostGame_StartRoysTrial)
IfNoSelectedGoto(1)
MoveToChapterWithoutWM(CHAPTER_TrialRoysTrial)
LABEL 1
EndEvent

BeginningScene:
FlagON(DisableObjectiveWindowFlag)
LOAD3 0x0 Units
LOAD1 0x1 Enemies
ENUN
EndEvent

EndingScene:
ENDA

